しい...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャプテン デイビスお疲れ様でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/17/9690287/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京個握ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/17/9690287/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りの虹鱒Tシャツ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツとスカートは\nDot&Stripesで\n帽子はカオリノモリです( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部3部は違う服着たんだけど\n写メを撮り忘れてしまって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも前々回のブログで着ていた\nボーダーのトップスに1部と同じスカートを\n履いていました～～( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の3部制\nただただ楽しかったです( ^ω^ )\n29日の握手会も楽しみにしています♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてですね、握手会のあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急いでとある場所へ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は将棋フォーカス内でも話が\nあがっていましたが、\n将棋連盟フットサル部に\nお邪魔してきちゃいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/17/9690287/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、なんと豪華なお写真...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、将棋好きの\n元サッカー日本代表の波戸さん小村さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして棋士の方々の豪華さ...\nA級棋士が4人もいらっしゃるなんて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、A級棋士というのは\n乃木坂で例えるとするならば\nフロントレベルですね。\n本当に凄いメンバーでのフットサルです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は中学3年間サッカー部でしたが\n運動神経皆無なのでド下手で(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私が7年ぶりにボールに触ったので\n恐ろしく下手っぴで\n皆様にはご迷惑をおかけしました...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも気を遣わせてしまって、\n私がボールを持って走ると、\n道が開いていく状況。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかったので\nお邪魔でなければ\n是非また参加させていただきたいなあと\n思いました(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/17/9690287/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎タイトル...がかりん↑ちゃんパートだったとは(*^.^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そうなのそうなの( ^ω^ )\n声聞き分けてみてね♡\nそしてかき氷の片想いの感想\nお待ちしています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間にアルバム発売まで\nあと1週間( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/17/9690287/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"},"cr