break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無名ちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『生駒っ！！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って呼ぶのめちゃ自分に置き換えてしまうのよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、何話目だったっけなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丁度じょしらくの稽古中のカバネリでね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れ〜！！生駒〜〜っっっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って逞生達が叫んでて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それも全然自分には言われてないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手に拝借して、自分の糧にしました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菖蒲様の血を貰った時はドキドキしました(^-^)(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菖蒲様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、無名ちゃんはお米をたくさん食べてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カバネリは、女の子みんな可愛いですね(ง ˙ω˙)ว"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鰍ちゃん、嫁に貰いたい。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/07/8063110/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でも生駒くんになった写真撮りましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売日まで秘密しておきますね(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この生駒くんのウィッグの制作を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達のコスプレイヤーのロゼさんに依頼しましたっ！！"},{"type":"br